  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Stunning 3-Story Home with Carriage House -<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Come discover the wonders of Pure Joy...in every sense of the word!  This beautiful beach home with carriage house is nestled among Seagrove's most desirable neighborhoods. 160 N Andalusia Avenue sits steps away from the sugar-white sand & emerald green waters.  This home will not disappoint...with 2 neighborhood pools, one of which is directly across the street,  and a tennis court<br><br><br><br>This 4 bedroom, 3.5 bath home with a 1 bedroom, 1 bath Carriage house, will soon be your favorite Scenic 30A vacation spot!  Upon arrival, guests will notice ample parking for 4 vehicles in the long driveway. Surrounded by the sights & sounds of nature, you are sure to enjoy both the peace & privacy, while still being close to all the action & activities 30A has to offer!  Cozy up around the outdoor fire pit & seating area after a long day at the beach!  Or enjoy one of the many screened-in porches...perfect for coffee or cocktails morning, noon, & night!  This large outdoor space also features a built-in gas grill for those daytime barbecues or for nights you're looking to stay in to spend time with family & friends.<br><br><br><br>Both the main & carriage house offer beautiful fully stocked kitchens outfitted with granite countertops & all updated stainless steel appliances.  The main also includes a wine cooler, spacious island, & a breakfast bar providing 4 additional seats.<br><br><br><br>This coastal chic home sleeps 12 comfortably with 3 king-size beds & custom built bunks in the main house & another king-size bed in the carriage.  There are TVs in every bedroom, as well as both living areas.  The master bedroom offers a private screened-in porch & a balcony off the 3rd-floor bedroom.  Suitable for families of all ages, kids can enjoy the board games, puzzles, & books provided.  Don't miss out on all the amazing amenities this home has to offer...unforgettable memories await!!<br><br><br><br>Guests under the age of 25 must be accompanied by an adult chaperone throughout their stay. Parties, events, pets, smoking are not permitted on the property.<br><br><br><br>PLEASE NOTE:  If any of the 12 beach chairs are damaged, lost, or stolen there will be a $200 charge per chair to replace.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Pure Joy - Stunning Three Story Home with Carriage"
        }
      ],
